    "detailed_description": "In this world, colors live scattered across their individual regions. Violent robots are around every corner and there is an unsettling sense of fear everywhere. Struggling to survive each day, one cannot care about others, but it wasn't always like that. The colors were gentle and united in the past. There were no robots. Something must have happened. Uncover the truth behind the lies told in this first-person shooter.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will explore different regions, each with its own biome, weapons and enemies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFind pieces of hidden history and fix whatever happened to this place.",
